<title>JAPAN: Kato Denki to change name to K's Denki.</title>
<headline>Kato Denki to change name to K's Denki.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese consumer electronics retailer Kato Denki Co Ltd said on Tuesday it plans to change its name to K's Denki Corp on November 1.</p>
<p>Kato said the company had decided to adopt a new name in order to revitalise and further develop its business.</p>
</text>
